---
// B2 — Proof strip, on the dark opening passage (27 Aug): header, hero and
// this strip share the ink-black ground, so the page opens dark and only
// lightens after the fault list. The PM credential deliberately does not
// appear here (vetted out — it lives in B9).
---

<section class="proof" aria-label="Clients">
  <div class="wrap proof-row">
    <span class="t-micro dim">DELIVERED FOR</span>
    <span class="client">David Jackson &amp; Son</span>
    <span class="client">WulfTek Tuning</span>
    <span class="t-micro dim tail">ONE PERSON, START TO FINISH</span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .proof {
    background: var(--color-ink-deep);
    border-top: var(--hairline-dark);
    border-bottom: var(--hairline-dark);
    padding-block: 26px;
  }
  .proof-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px 40px;
  }
  .dim { color: rgb(245 247 249 / 0.45); }
  .client { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-sheet); }
  .tail { margin-left: auto; }
  @media (max-width: 639.98px) {
    .tail { margin-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
